The clock tree has violations that CCOpt may not be able to correct due to the design settings.
A common cause is that the violation occurs in a part of the design (e.g. an ILM) that CCOpt cannot change.
Consider reviewing your design and relaunching CCOpt.


Max Capacitance Violations
--------------------------

Did not meet the max_capacitance constraint of 0.035pF below the root driver for clock_tree SPI_CLK at (1617.825,1042.000), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net spi_clk_i which has internal don't touch reasons: {is_pad_net}. Achieved capacitance of 1.383pF.

Did not meet the max_capacitance constraint of 0.035pF below the root driver for clock_tree JTAG_CLK at (602.000,12.175), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net tck_i which has internal don't touch reasons: {is_pad_net}. Achieved capacitance of 1.383pF.

Did not meet the max_capacitance constraint of 0.035pF below the root driver for clock_tree CLK at (778.000,1701.825), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net clk which has internal don't touch reasons: {is_pad_net}. Achieved capacitance of 1.383pF.

Max Slew Violations
-------------------

Found 2 slew violations below the root driver for clock_tree SPI_CLK at (1617.825,1042.000), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net spi_clk_i which has internal don't touch reasons: {is_pad_net} with half corner delay_corner_wcl_slow:setup.late. The worst violation was at the pin spi_clk_i with a slew time target of 0.112ns. Achieved a slew time of 0.540ns.


Found 2 slew violations below the root driver for clock_tree JTAG_CLK at (602.000,12.175), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net tck_i which has internal don't touch reasons: {is_pad_net} with half corner delay_corner_wcl_slow:setup.late. The worst violation was at the pin tck_i with a slew time target of 0.112ns. Achieved a slew time of 0.540ns.


Found 2 slew violations below the root driver for clock_tree CLK at (778.000,1701.825), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net clk which has internal don't touch reasons: {is_pad_net} with half corner delay_corner_wcl_slow:setup.late. The worst violation was at the pin clk with a slew time target of 0.112ns. Achieved a slew time of 0.540ns.



